  "title": "Myanmar's Genocide Ruling Sets New Legal and Global Standards",
  "summary": "The International Court of Justice (ICJ) ruled Myanmar guilty of genocide against the Rohingya minority in 2017, marking a historic and unprecedented decision. The ruling also highlights the broader implications for international accountability and human rights.",
