    {
      "title": "A Village Burned, Its People Killed or Exiled. A Court Ruled It Was Genocide.",
      "link": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/19/world/asia/myanmar-rohingya-village-refugee-genocide.html",
      "description": "Zammona’s erasure was part of a wider campaign of violence against Rohingya Muslims. An international court found that Myanmar was culpable for the atrocities.",
